# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated data, databases & indexes
#   NOTE: data/source/ holds the supplied assessment source pack (PDF/XLSX).
#   Those are inputs, not build artifacts. Decide deliberately whether to
#   commit them -- see docs/architecture.md. They are NOT ignored here.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
# Ignore directory *contents*, not the directories themselves -- git will not
# descend into an excluded directory, so `!dir/.gitkeep` cannot rescue a file
# when `dir/` itself is ignored.
data/processed/*
data/index/*
!data/processed/.gitkeep
!data/index/.gitkeep

# Local vector store / embedding caches
.chroma/
chroma/
*.faiss
*.index
embeddings_cache/

